---
import { learningTracks } from "@/data/learning-plan"
import learningProgress from "@/data/learning-progress.json"
import { getTrackStats, normalizeLearningProgress } from "@/lib/learning-progress"

const track = learningTracks.find((item) => item.id === "agent")!
const progress = normalizeLearningProgress(learningProgress)
const stats = getTrackStats("agent", progress)
---

<section id="agent-learning-results" class="agent-learning-results" aria-labelledby="agent-results-title">
  <div class="agent-learning-results__heading">
    <h2 id="agent-results-title">学习成果</h2>
    <span>{stats.completed} / {stats.total} 章已完成</span>
  </div>
  <p>这份笔记按原目录记录 44 章内容，将机制解析、公式代码、参考架构、配图和原始资料汇集成一份可以持续查阅的 Agent 知识地图。</p>
  <ul>
    {track.units.map((unit) => (
      <li>
        <a href={unit.href.slice(unit.href.indexOf("#"))}>{unit.title}</a>
        <span>{unit.tasks.filter((task) => progress.completedAt[task.id]).length} / {unit.tasks.length} 章</span>
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>
  <a class="agent-learning-results__progress" href="/learning/#agent">查看 Progress 中的逐章成果</a>
</section>

<style>
  .agent-learning-results {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.5rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 1rem;
    background: var(--card);
  }
  .agent-learning-results__heading {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }
  .agent-learning-results__heading h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }
  .agent-learning-results__heading > span,
  .agent-learning-results li > span {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .agent-learning-results ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.8rem;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .agent-learning-results li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .agent-learning-results__progress {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }
</style>
